/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Rutherford County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, April to May hit 157% of normal and November to December fell to 57%. So far in 2026, February to March and March to April each sit at 53% of normal.</p>"}
